{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おひさし昨日ぶり〜♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ﾁｸﾀｸﾁｸﾀｸ\nｼﾞﾘﾘﾘﾘ- ̗̀⏰𓈒 𓂂𓏸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "“みーちゃんのぶろぐ”のお時間になったで～！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も見に来てくれてありがと〜♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大阪府出身19歳の大田美月です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現在発売中の『BRODY10月号』さんの日向坂46 五期生連載【革命前夜】第3回として、高井と撮影した時のオフショット載せていくよ〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobrAXXXm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobBMEH0L.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "雑誌の撮影では浴衣着るの初めてだったのっ♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏らしさMAXで嬉しいーっ💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣の色も2人ともぴったりじゃないっ？！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影前にね、二人で衣装見てどっちがどっちの浴衣だろうね〜って予想してたんだけど、もちろんイメージ通りの方で予想的中だった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mob0bKJ22.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣で花火もしたよ〜🎇"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mob0NRF1C.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高井がかき氷も作ってくれたし🍧\n私はそれを応援してた〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mob8tLgAv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に初めての共同作業も...？！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobd2V7JZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に作ったかき氷を食べてみたり〜😽"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高井と夏の思い出が作れてとっても楽しかったよっ！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特典ポストカードもあるのでぜひゲットしてくれたら嬉しいですっ(՞ ܸ. .ܸ՞)♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobJZOmtt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｡*⑅୨୧┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈୨୧⑅*｡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も最後まで構ってくれてありがと〜♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日は三期生の山口陽世さんの卒業セレモニーです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後のはるよさん。素敵な時間になりますように⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📼⋆. 夏色 / ゆずさん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はここまで！\nまた次のブログで会おうね〜♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "以上、大田美月でした🍓\nまたね〜♡素敵な1日になりますように✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#みーちゃんのぶろぐ\n#212"}], "source": "official"}